          <li>use false information, impersonation or deception to obtain access;</li>
          <li>copy, adapt, decompile, disassemble, decipher or reverse engineer the services except where applicable law permits it;</li>
          <li>bypass or interfere with payment checks, licence controls, security features, HWID controls or abuse-prevention systems;</li>
          <li>use bots, scrapers or automated extraction tools against the services without written permission;</li>
          <li>upload malware, spam or content intended to disrupt or overload the services;</li>
          <li>use the services to facilitate unauthorised access, credential theft, piracy, infringement or other unlawful conduct;</li>
          <li>submit fraudulent, knowingly false, abusive or bad-faith payment claims, reports or support requests;</li>
          <li>harass, threaten, abuse, impersonate or unlawfully discriminate against staff or other users;</li>
          <li>advertise unauthorised commercial or competing services through our private channels; or</li>
          <li>use the services in a way that violates applicable law, third-party rights or these terms.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Enforcement will be proportionate to the nature, severity, evidence
