          suspend access or terminate access under Section 12.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="tos-card" id="contributions">
        <h2>9. Contributions, feedback and reviews</h2>

        <p>
          The services may allow you to submit messages, reviews, feedback,
          screenshots, suggestions or other materials. You remain responsible
          for what you submit and must have the rights and permissions needed to
          submit it.
        </p>

        <p>
          You grant us a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to host,
          store, reproduce, display, moderate, edit and use your contribution
          only as reasonably necessary to operate, provide, protect, support,
          promote and improve the services.
        </p>

        <p>
          We do not claim ownership of your contributions. We may remove or
          moderate content that we reasonably believe is unlawful, infringing,
          abusive, threatening, discriminatory, obscene, misleading, spam or
          otherwise unsuitable for the service.
        </p>

        <p>
          Reviews must reflect your genuine experience. We will not prevent you
          from publishing an honest review or making a lawful complaint.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="tos-card" id="privacy">
        <h2>10. Privacy</h2>

        <p>
          We handle personal information in accordance with our
          {' '}
          <a href={privacyUrl}>Privacy Policy</a>. The Privacy Policy explains
          what information we collect, why we use it, which third parties may
          process it, how long it is kept and how privacy rights can be
          exercised.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="tos-card" id="support">
        <h2>11. Support, availability, updates and maintenance</h2>

